---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Arkbridge Systems | Advanced AI/ML & Custom Software Development">
	
	<section class="hero">
		<h1>Next-Generation Predictive Intelligence & Systems Engineering</h1>
		<p class="subtitle">Delivering mission-critical Custom Software, Data Analytics, and Logistical Machine Learning models to U.S. Federal Agencies.</p>
		<div class="badge-row">
			<span class="badge">U.S. Small Business</span>
			<span class="badge">NAICS 541511 Primary</span>
			<span class="badge">Pre-Award Ready</span>
		</div>
	</section>

	<hr class="section-divider" />

	<section id="competencies" class="grid-section">
		<div class="section-heading">
			<h2>Core Competencies</h2>
			<p>High-performance engineering built for federal modernization initiatives.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="cards-grid">
			<div class="card">
				<h3>Logistical AI & ML Prediction</h3>
				<p>Development of custom, edge-ready predictive machine learning algorithms optimizing complex asset allocation, supply chain workflows, and predictive maintenance schedules for tactical defense frameworks.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="card">
				<h3>Enterprise Data Analytics</h3>
				<p>Architecting secure, compliant real-time data streaming pipelines, schema generation (OpenAPI/Swagger), and data ingestion systems handling disparate government data structures.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="card">
				<h3>Bespoke Software Development</h3>
				<p>Full-stack, serverless software engineering operating native edge routing. Built on rigid modern frameworks to maintain zero client-side vulnerability surfaces (OPSEC compliant).</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<hr class="section-divider" />

	<section id="corporate-data" class="data-section">
		<div class="section-heading">
			<h2>Corporate Data</h2>
			<p>Direct indexing parameters for immediate procurement verification.</p>
		</div>
		
		<div class="data-table-container">
			<table class="data-table">
				<tbody>
					<tr>
						<td><strong>Legal Business Name:</strong></td>
						<td>Arkbridge Systems LLC</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td><strong>Unique Entity ID (UEI):</strong></td>
						<td class="monospaced">[PENDING / ASSIGNED BY SAM.GOV]</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td><strong>CAGE Code:</strong></td>
						<td class="monospaced">[PENDING APPLICATION]</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td><strong>Socioeconomic Status:</strong></td>
						<td>Uncategorized Small Business</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td><strong>Place of Performance:</strong></td>
						<td>Florida / Nationwide Remote Capable</td>
					</tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>

			<div class="naics-box">
				<h3>Registered NAICS Codes</h3>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>541511</strong> &mdash; Custom Computer Programming Services (Primary)</li>
					<li><strong>541512</strong> &mdash; Computer Systems Design Services</li>
					<li><strong>541519</strong> &mdash; Other Computer Related Services</li>
					<li><strong>541715</strong> &mdash; Research and Development in the Physical, Engineering, and Life Sciences</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<hr class="section-divider" />

	<section id="differentiators" class="grid-section">
		<div class="section-heading">
			<h2>Differentiators</h2>
			<p>Why federal entities and prime integration partners select our technical capabilities.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="diff-container">
			<div class="diff-item">
				<h4>Ex-FAANG Architecture Standards</h4>
				<p>Our engineering leads bring elite, industry-vetted backgrounds from hyper-scale technology companies, introducing massive code efficiency, robust automated testing, and scalable performance metrics rarely found in legacy contracting pools.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="diff-item">
				<h4>Agile Edge Infrastructure</h4>
				<p>By leveraging serverless edge-computing ecosystems, we deploy high-velocity microservices capable of processing intense predictive ML modeling pipelines with minimal infrastructure overhead, keeping project costs radically optimized.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<hr class="section-divider" />

	<section id="contact" class="contact-section">
		<h2>Capture Management & RFI Intake</h2>
		<p>For teaming agreements, sub-contracting requests, or RFI inquiries, contact our core management team directly.</p>
		<div class="contact-card">
			<p><strong>Email:</strong>secure-inbox@arkbridgesystems.com</p>
			<p><strong>Corporate Address:</strong>300 East University Avenue, 1st Floor, Gainesville, Florida 32601</p>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>

<style>
	.hero {
		padding: 4rem 0;
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 2.75rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		line-height: 1.2;
		color: var(--navy-primary);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.subtitle {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		color: var(--text-main);
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.badge-row {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.badge {
		background-color: #e2e8f0;
		color: var(--navy-light);
		padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
		border-radius: 20px;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
	}

	.section-divider {
		border: 0;
		height: 1px;
		background: var(--border-color);
		margin: 4rem 0;
	}

	.section-heading {
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
	}

	.section-heading h2 {
		font-size: 2rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.section-heading p {
		color: var(--text-main);
	}

	.cards-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.card {
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 6px;
		background-color: #fafafa;
		border-top: 4px solid var(--accent-blue);
	}

	.card h3 {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.data-section-container {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	.data-table-container {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
		gap: 3rem;
		align-items: start;
	}

	.data-table {
		width: 100%;
		border-collapse: collapse;
	}

	.data-table td {
		padding: 0.75rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
	}

	.monospaced {
		font-family: monospace;
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: var(--accent-blue);
	}

	.naics-box {
		background-color: var(--navy-primary);
		color: #ffffff;
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 6px;
	}

	.naics-box h3 {
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--navy-light);
		padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.naics-box ul {
		list-style-type: none;
	}

	.naics-box li {
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.diff-container {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.diff-item h4 {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--accent-blue);
	}

	.contact-section {
		text-align: center;
		background-color: #f8fafc;
		padding: 3rem;
		border-radius: 6px;
		border: 1px dashed var(--border-color);
	}

	.contact-section h2 {
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.contact-card {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.data-table-container {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 2rem;
		}
	}
</style>
